.TH PROTOCOL\-API 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 0.1.0" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
protocol\-api \- Serve the Unheaded Protocol API over HTTP and gRPC, backed by mock data or pinned BPF maps.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B protocol\-api
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serve the Unheaded Protocol API over HTTP and gRPC, backed by mock data or pinned BPF maps.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-api\-key \fISTRING\fR
API key for authentication (empty = disabled)
.TP
.B \-\-bpf\-maps \fISTRING\fR
Path to pinned BPF maps (default /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded)
.TP
.B \-\-log
Enable request logging (default true)
.TP
.B \-\-mock
Alias for \-\-mode=mock (deprecated)
.TP
.B \-\-mode \fISTRING\fR
Backend mode: mock (in\-memory) or bpf (pinned maps) (default mock)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
protocol\-api \-\-mode mock
protocol\-api \-\-mode bpf \-\-bpf\-maps /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
